<title>UK: World Bank says hires New Zealand treasurer.</title>
<headline>World Bank says hires New Zealand treasurer.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The World Bank has hired Graeme Wheeler, treasurer of the New Zealand Debt Management Office, a senior official said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Jessica Einhorn, the World Bank's managing director for finance and resource mobilisation, said at a conference in London that Wheeler would join the World Bank's treasury team, headed by Gary Perlin.</p>
<p>-- Aline van Duyn, London Newsroom +44 171 542 7748</p>
